he curve $y={x}^{4}-5$ at the point $(-1,-4)$ intersects the $x$-axis." :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)={x}^{4}-5.$ Let's first calculate the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{4}-5)=4{x}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the slope of the tangent at our point is\n\n$$\nm={f}^{′}(-1)=4(-1)^{3}=-4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the tangent is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-(-4) & =-4(x+1) \\\\ y & =-4x-4-4 \\\\ y & =-4x-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find where the tangent line intercepts the $x$-axis, we set $y=0$ and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0 & =-4x-8 \\\\ x & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point of intersection is $(-2,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f835e1bd-3b54-55df-a86e-257a12043f7d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f835e1bd-3b54-55df-a86e-257a12043f7d" :answer-field/id #uuid "f835e1bd-3b54-55df-a86e-257a12043f7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-2100eb44-8e72-5719-a8fb-e972472e7b8d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2100eb44-8e72-5719-a8fb-e972472e7b8d" "answer-935da744-e556-5c18-a8cc-a2c7a2f6857a" "answer-22f32eae-9185-592c-b114-6d8226facae0" "answer-5c20e79a-0749-5b55-81fe-8813ae3eba71" "answer-bdb0da78-826f-5f6f-9793-f49944deb785"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2100eb44-8e72-5719-a8fb-e972472e7b8d" :answer/id #uuid "2100eb44-8e72-5719-a8fb-e972472e7b8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-935da744-e556-5c18-a8cc-a2c7a2f6857a" :answer/id #uuid "935da744-e556-5c18-a8cc-a2c7a2f6857a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-5,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-22f32eae-9185-592c-b114-6d8226facae0" :answer/id #uuid "22f32eae-9185-592c-b114-6d8226facae0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,0)" :db/ensure 